From 8f49e5d68a1a34c026bbeaccbeeb085eb2028267 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:23:15 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(api): persistent organization, project and workspace
 management (#410)

Completes organization, project and workspace management on the existing
PostgreSQL schema; no migrations.

- update/archive for all three, parent-scoped lists, optimistic concurrency
- organization membership and ownership transfer on Membership/Role
- access inside an organization comes from ownership or active membership
- archive cascades; parent rows are locked so no child can be created under
  an archived parent
- non-Latin names no longer derive an empty slug

